{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2007-common-biology-22","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2007,"subject":"biology","number":22,"points":null,"unitId":"neuro","unitLabel":"신경·근육·감각","topic":"막전위·전압의존성·이온통로","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["neuro","reproduction","cell","development"],"stem":"성게의수정된알은여러이온의유출입으로활성화된다. 그림은\n수정직후이온들의유출입과알의활성화를나타낸모식도이다.\n위와관련한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고르면?\n<보\n기>\n＋유입은세포막전위를탈분극시켜새로운정자의침입을\nㄱ. Na\n막는다.\nㄴ. Ca2＋의증가는세포막의전압의존성Ca2＋이온통로가개방\n되어나타난다.\n2＋의\nㄷ. 다수정방지과정에서‘느린차단(slow block)’은Ca\n증가에따라수정막을형성하는과정이다.\n＋의유출은수정란내pH를증가시켜첫번째난할에\nㄹ. H\n필요한유전자의전사를활성화시킨다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":726,"height":367,"region":0,"bbox":[23.256,52.868,290.4,146.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-common-biology-22/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":393,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,246.068,308.8,157.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2007-common-biology-22/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":10,"sourceRect":[82.744,152.732,416.5,589.756],"width":333.756,"height":437.024,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[23.256,52.868,290.4,146.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,246.068,308.8,157.2],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"22. 성게의수정된알은여러이온의유출입으